        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "For sale by Online Auction on Thursday the 12th November 2026 at 4pm.\n\nA substantial 4-bedroom detached two-storey residence with a separate 7 roomed Annex and agricultural shed all set on c. 25 acres of land. The property is tucked away along a quiet laneway and enjoys a peaceful, mature setting. The house has some lovely features including exposed stone walls and wooden beams. The property which has been vacant for 10 or more years is in need of upgrading and modernisation and should qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant Scheme (subject to terms conditions - check government websites for further details under vacant property refurbishment grants)\nServices include electricity (to be re-connected) mains water and septic tank on site.\n\nThe Annex which has 7 rooms is unfinished internally and has no services connected but are available for connection.\n\nThe land is off mixed quality and is set mainly to the side and rear of the property.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity for purchasers seeking a small holding, hobby farm or residential farm property with Airbnb potential for the cottage.\nThe property is located approx. 6.5km from Dromahair and 9km from Drumkeeran.\n\nLegal: Adrienne O Connor Solr, Home Farm Conveyancing Solrs , Manorhamilton.\n\nONLINE AUCTION REGISTRATION: All intending online bidders must register at dmauctions.marteye.ie and contact DM Auctions, Manorhamilton to organise their registration. A deposit of ?10,000 is payable in order to be accepted to bid on the day of Auction by Monday the 9th of November 2026. Email leitrim@dmauctions.ie or call 071 9856444 to register or for further details.\n \n\nAccommodation\n\nKitchen / Breakfast Area\n7.55m x 4.31m\n\nLiving Room\n3.82m x 3.65m\n\nReception Room\n44.08m x 2.77m\n\nBedroom -other\n3.58m x 2.32m\n\nShower Room\n2.22m x 1.78m\n\nBedroom 2\n4.16m x 3.61m\n\nBedroom 3\n3.07m x 2.65m\n\nBedroom 4\n4.02m x 3.67m\n\nBathroom\n2.95m x 1.82m\n\n"
      },
